<title>DENMARK: Denmark's Lauritzen buys Finland's Pipemasters.</title>
<headline>Denmark's Lauritzen buys Finland's Pipemasters.</headline>
<dateline>COPENHAGEN 1997-06-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Danish shipping and industrial group J.Lauritzen said on Tuesday that its Aalborg Industries boilermaking unit had signed a letter of intent to buy Finnish firm Pipemasters Oy.</p>
<p>A Lauritzen statement said that the Finnish firm had an annual turnover of 80 million Danish crowns but did not disclose the purchase price.</p>
<p>It said that the acquisition was expected to increase Aalborg Industries' annual turnover to 1.7 billion crowns, from 1.3 billion in 1996. --Steve Weizman, Copenhagen newsroom +45 33969650</p>
